# Open WebUI basic template (testing preview)
#
# No API keys are required for this draft localhost-only setup.
# WEBUI_AUTH is disabled in docker-compose for local testing only.
#
# Optional: run ollama.basic on the host (port 18084) so the UI can list models.
# OLLAMA_BASE_URL defaults to http://host.docker.internal:18084
#
# UI and app data are stored under:
#   <IOE_DATA_DIR>/apps/open-webui.basic/data/
